# Nice confirmations

Never use `window.confirm()`, `confirm()`, or browser alert dialogs for user confirmations in this app.

Use the global styled modal instead:

1. **Forms** — add data attributes:
   ```html
   <form
     method="POST"
     action="..."
     data-bynnas-confirm="Short explanation of what happens."
     data-bynnas-confirm-title="Short title?"
     data-bynnas-confirm-ok="Confirm action"
     data-bynnas-confirm-tone="emerald|sky|amber|rose"
   >
   ```

2. **JS / Alpine** — await the helper:
   ```js
   const ok = await window.bynnasConfirm({
     title: '…',
     message: '…',
     okLabel: '…',
     tone: 'emerald', // or sky | amber | rose
   });
   if (ok) { /* proceed */ }
   ```

Component: `resources/views/components/nice-confirm.blade.php` (included in `layouts/app.blade.php`).
